### Order Modifications

| Interaction Subject | Definition |
|---|---|
| **Address Change** | Customer entered the wrong address at checkout. We were able to update the address before the order left the warehouse. |
| **In Transit Address Change** | Customer entered the wrong address at checkout. We were **not** able to update before shipment — address was updated with the carrier while the order was in transit. |
| **Return to Sender** | Customer requested to cancel after the order shipped. We requested FedEx return the items to sender. |
| **Item Removal** | Customer requested removal of an item from their order before it shipped. |
| **Item Change** | Customer requested to swap items on their order before it shipped. Items removed and customer charged for new items on a new order. |
| **Order Verification** | Order was flagged by Shopify for Medium or High Risk. We reached out to the customer to confirm validity. |

