### Waived Physical Return (Return Alternative)

| Interaction Subject | Definition | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Buyer Remorse** | Customer decides to return their purchase for reasons outside NJ's control, or the purchase needs to be refunded (with no return) for reasons outside NJ's control. Refund/store credit is **not** coordinated through the Return Center. **Not to be confused with "Return Question."** | Changed their mind; no longer wants/needs; purchased by accident; item doesn't match or fit their space; ordered wrong color/size/variant |

