### Cancellation Request

| Interaction Subject | Definition | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| *(None)* | Customer asks to cancel their order — changed their mind, wants to order something else, or made a mistake. Still applicable if order has already shipped (pair with Resolution: RTS or Physical Return). Also applicable when customers request to cancel their replacement orders in favor of a refund — create a separate draft conversation in Kustomer to categorize this. | |

