### Questions

| Interaction Subject | Definition | Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Product Question** | Customer asks a question about a specific product or group of products. | "What's the height of this unit?"; "Can you recommend a product that pairs well with XYZ?"; "Will vinyl records fit on the shelves?" |
| **(No SKU) Materials/Certifications Question** | Product questions unrelated to specific SKUs. | "What does 'solid wood veneer' mean?"; "Can I use scotchguard on PU leather?"; "Can I order color samples?" |
| **Payment/Coupon Question** | Customer asks about their payment, order, or discount — unrelated to a price match/adjustment or return refund not processed automatically. | "Did my order go through?"; "Was I charged twice?"; "Do you have any discounts I can apply?" |
| **Where's My Stuff — Backorder Update** | Customer asks for a status update on a backordered order. | |
| **Where's My Stuff — Non-Backorder Update** | Customer asks for a status update on an order that is NOT backordered. | |
| **Where's My Stuff — Separated Shipments** | Customer asks for a status update on the remainder of their order after some items already delivered. | "I ordered 4 chairs but only received 2, when are the rest arriving?" |
| **Where's My Stuff — Zone-Skip Confusion** | Customer asks for a status update on an order in "Label Created" status en route to the Kentucky Shipping Hub. | "My order said it shipped Tuesday but it's Friday and still 'Label Created' — when are you actually shipping it?" |
| **Return Question (Initiate Physical Return / General Return Policy Question)** | Customer asks about return policies or how to initiate a return. Direct them to the returns portal or create a return on their behalf. | |
| **Return Question (Need More Labels)** | Customer initiated a return through the Return Center but either input it incorrectly/incompletely and needs more labels, or is requesting more labels but doesn't realize enough were already emailed. | "I purchased a set of 4 stools and only received one label." |
| **Return Question (Refund Not Processed Automatically)** | Customer physically returned items to the warehouse but the refund was not processed automatically for any reason (customer mistakes, system errors, tracking/FedEx issues, system limitations). Includes cases where only some items on an order were refunded automatically. | "I returned 4 stools but was only refunded for two."; "My return was delivered last month but I still haven't been refunded." |
| **Return Question (Schedule or Reschedule Pickup Only)** | Customer requests to schedule a pickup after their return was submitted as drop-off, or asks to reschedule a pickup. ***Not to be used if the customer is inquiring about a general return and asks about pickup options*** — use Return Question (Initiate Physical Return/General Return Policy Question) instead. | "FedEx didn't show up during the allotted time."; "I chose drop-off but want to change it to pickup." |
| **Return Question (Other Return Question — Explain Below)** | Any return question not covered by the options above. **Very important: add detail in the Cust Issue/Comments field.** These details inform which contact reason options are added in the future. | "I returned 3 stools but was refunded for 4."; "I accidentally returned the wrong item."; "Customer is unable to start a return due to a technical error." |
| **Return Question (Change Refund Method)** | Customer requests to change their refund method for a ParcelLab return. | "Can I get a refund instead of the store credit I was sent?" |
| **Trade Account / Designer Discount** | Customer inquires about setting up a wholesale or trade account, or asks about associated discounts. | "I'm a designer, can I set up a trade account?"; "I'd like to be a wholesaler, what's the process?" |
| **Bulk Order** | Customer is planning or interested in placing a bulk order. | "I need to purchase 60 stools — do you have a discount for bulk orders?" |
| **Tax Exempt Inquiry** | Customer seeks info or assistance setting up a tax-exempt account or getting a tax refund. | "I'm a designer, can I purchase tax-free?"; "My organization is tax-exempt — can you refund the tax on my last order?" |
| **Shipping Options/Services** | Customer inquires about shipping/hold options or where we ship. | "Which carrier will deliver my package?"; "Do you ship to the UK?"; "Do you offer white glove delivery?"; "Can you hold my order until X date?"; "Do you offer assembly services?" |
| **Product Availability** | Customer asks when a product will come back into stock. | |
| **Warranty Registration / General Warranty Info** | Customer reaches out to register their item for our Lifetime Warranty or has general warranty questions. **Note: Warranty claims are considered Product Issues — choose the interaction subject that best describes the warranty issue (Defective, Unstable, Finishing, etc.).** | "Can you register my X for the lifetime warranty?"; "Does your warranty cover fabric stains?"; "If I purchase from Amazon, does your warranty still apply?" |

