### Other Contact Types

| Type | Definition | Notes / Examples |
|---|---|---|
| **Incomplete Info** | Customer reached out by chat, did not supply alternative contact information, did not respond to chat messages, AND the chat AI/assistant was not able to resolve all of their concerns. | "Hello is this Nathan James"; "How can I build my own? I need dimensions." |
| **Missed Callback** | Selected when we call back after a missed call but the customer did not pick up. Do not use "Incomplete Info" for this purpose. | Only used if we do not have a recent conversation to merge the callback into. |

