## Inquiry Medium in Airtable

The communication channel from which Nathan James received an interaction.

| Inquiry Medium | Description |
|---|---|
| **CH Ticket** | Kustomer ticket via email, chat, or phone call |
| **Retailer Portal** | Retailer portals |
| **Customer Review** | Review from a retailer website |
| **Retailer Report** | Information from a report provided by a retailer |
| **Payment Remittance** | Interactions whose source came from a retailer remittance advice |
| **Influencer** | Information provided by an influencer |
| **Internal** | Product issue submitted by Nathan James or friends/family |
